{"page":482,"verses":[{"verse_key":"41:47","surah":41,"ayah":47,"ar_uthmani":"۞ إِلَيْهِ يُرَدُّ عِلْمُ ٱلسَّاعَةِ ۚ وَمَا تَخْرُجُ مِن ثَمَرَٰتٍ مِّنْ أَكْمَامِهَا وَمَا تَحْمِلُ مِنْ أُنثَىٰ وَلَا تَضَعُ إِلَّا بِعِلْمِهِۦ ۚ وَيَوْمَ يُنَادِيهِمْ أَيْنَ شُرَكَآءِى قَالُوٓا۟ ءَاذَنَّـٰكَ مَا مِنَّا مِن شَهِيدٍ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Knowledge of the Hour belongs solely to Him and no crop comes out of its sheath, nor does any female conceive or give birth, without His knowledge. On the Day He asks them, ‘Where are My partners?’ they will answer, ‘We admit to You that none of us can see [them]’:","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"۞ إِلَيْهِ","en_gloss":"To Him","transliteration":"ilayhi","verse_key":"41:47"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يُرَدُّ","en_gloss":"is referred","transliteration":"yuraddu","verse_key":"41:47"},{"pos":3,"ar":"عِلْمُ","en_gloss":"(the) knowledge","transliteration":"ʿil'mu","verse_key":"41:47"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلسَّاعَةِ ۚ","en_gloss":"(of) the Hour","transliteration":"l-sāʿati","verse_key":"41:47"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"And not","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"41:47"},{"pos":6,"ar":"تَخْرُجُ","en_gloss":"comes out","transliteration":"takhruju","verse_key":"41:47"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"any","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"41:47"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ثَمَرَٰتٍۢ","en_gloss":"fruits","transliteration":"thamarātin","verse_key":"41:47"},{"pos":9,"ar":"مِّنْ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"41:47"},{"pos":10,"ar":"أَكْمَامِهَا","en_gloss":"their coverings","transliteration":"akmāmihā","verse_key":"41:47"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"and not","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"41:47"},{"pos":12,"ar":"تَحْمِلُ","en_gloss":"bears","transliteration":"taḥmilu","verse_key":"41:47"},{"pos":13,"ar":"مِنْ","en_gloss":"any","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"41:47"},{"pos":14,"ar":"أُنثَىٰ","en_gloss":"female","transliteration":"unthā","verse_key":"41:47"},{"pos":15,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"and not","transliteratio